  <h1 class="mb-5 mt-0 font-serif text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-[2.8rem]">How Long Do Sweepstakes Casino Redemptions Take?</h1>

  <p class="byline">
    By <a href="/authors/alex-rowan/">Alex Rowan</a> (editorial pen name, Social Casino Index research team).
    Published {{ publishedAt | readableDate }}. Last updated {{ updatedAt | readableDate }}.
