  <div class="answer-first" id="answer">
    <span class="af-label">Direct answer</span>
    <p><strong>By published terms, most sweepstakes casino redemptions take between about 2 days and 7 business days, and first redemptions take longer because identity verification runs before the payment.</strong> Chumba Casino states redemptions are processed within 2 days of approval. Pulsz quotes 3 to 7 business days for a first redemption. McLuck quotes 2 to 5 days by bank transfer after up to 72 hours of internal processing. Stake.us verifies identity in 2 to 3 business days before crypto delivery. WOW Vegas does not state a timeframe we could verify.</p>
    <p>These are the operators' own published terms, not our measurements. Our funded-testing dataset is in progress; every operator below is labeled <span class="badge pending">Pending</span> until a funded test completes.</p>
  </div>

